OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for Wester Ross
OL,6,Fotherwise rather cloudy with some
OL,7,Fshowers, one or two on the heavy side.
OL,8,FRather cool, freshening northeasterly
OL,9,Fwinds in far north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBecoming quite breezy during
OL,12,Fthe evening with scattered blustery
OL,13,Fshowers, towards the Great Glen seeing
OL,14,Fa little shelter from showers
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA cool day with further
OL,18,Fshowery conditions, some brighter
OL,19,Fweather between showers, perhaps some
OL,20,Fevening sunshine in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
